{"id":"n73438-1-7","stage":4,"title":"입실 · 入室","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73438-1-7-1","ko":"지금 바로 방으로 안내 받을 수 있을까요?","zh":"现在可以带我去房间吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"바로","meaning":"立即，立刻","explanation":"바로：立即，立刻","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"5","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}},{"text":"방으로","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방으로","audio":"/audio/55ca785acf039bbde85d.mp3"}},{"text":"안내","meaning":"带路，带领，向导","explanation":"안내：带路，带领，向导","readings":[{"term":"안내","audio":"/audio/eb81d7d96ba4e901770e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88853","senseId":"2","lemma":"안내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안내","audio":"/audio/eb81d7d96ba4e901770e.mp3"}},{"text":"받을","meaning":"接待，迎接，接受，录用","explanation":"받다：接待，迎接，接受，录用；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"12","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받을","audio":"/audio/1ce65fb87a94df252095.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있을까요?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을까요","audio":"/audio/ef6f1745d773e6085ac3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"a441b444c56119c0","term":"바로","zh":"立即，立刻","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3","entryId":"64744","definition":"无时间间隔，马上。","pronunciation":["바로"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"eb81d7d96ba4e901","term":"안내","zh":"带路，带领，向导","audio":"/audio/eb81d7d96ba4e901770e.mp3","entryId":"88853","definition":"引导某人去其不了解的地方或带着某人去想去的地方。","pronunciation":["안ː내"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接待，迎接，接受，录用","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"招待别人或让别人进去。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/023648a4fe873e810ba9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73438-1-7-2","ko":"죄송하지만 호텔 입실 시간까지 잠시만 기다려 주십시오.","zh":"抱歉，请等到酒店规定的入住时间。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송하지만","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송하지만","audio":"/audio/8f5e03e932bf717d558b.mp3"}},{"text":"호텔","meaning":"酒店，饭店，宾馆","explanation":"호텔：酒店，饭店，宾馆","readings":[{"term":"호텔","audio":"/audio/a8c93b78e5f25669c2a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30215","senseId":"1","lemma":"호텔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"호텔","audio":"/audio/a8c93b78e5f25669c2a4.mp3"}},{"text":"입실","meaning":"入室，进屋","explanation":"입실：入室，进屋","readings":[{"term":"입실","audio":"/audio/cb1ecadb2b3b081ba331.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73438","senseId":"1","lemma":"입실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입실","audio":"/audio/cb1ecadb2b3b081ba331.mp3"}},{"text":"시간까지","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간까지","audio":"/audio/8b86ab88d14650624174.mp3"}},{"text":"잠시만","meaning":"片刻，暂时","explanation":"잠시：片刻，暂时；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71203","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠시만","audio":"/audio/1cee9206eff4bf68c21d.mp3"}},{"text":"기다려","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다려","audio":"/audio/45f50f6f6dc05f2c8c0a.mp3"}},{"text":"주십시오.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㅂ시오：正式敬语的请求或命令语尾；通常与시合成십시오。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-